    "title": "Man accused of groping woman - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Writer ,\n14 hours ago\nLAYTON — A 48-year-old Miami Shores was arrested on Friday, Nov. 28, for allegedly touching a woman against her will at a local bar.\nJohn Vincent Krieny was charged with battery and committing an unnatural and lascivious act, according to the Monroe County Sheriff's Office.\nDeputies were called to the Lime Tree Bay Resort at 8:37 p.m. after a woman reported that a man, later identified as Krieny, groped her under her shirt and on her pants while she was at the bar. The woman said she was in fear and told Krieny, whom she did not know, to stop multiple times and that her husband would return shortly, reports say.\nKrieny appeared intoxicated. He was taken to jail.",
